ates personal costs from business costs. At its core this is an app with a form (how much did you spend?) and a list (here are the amounts you spent), but in order to accomplish those two things you\u2019re going to need to learn how to:  Present and dismiss a second screen of data. Delete rows from a list Save and load user data \u2026and more.  There\u2019s lots to do, so let\u2019s get started: create a new iOS app using the Single View App template, naming it \u201ciExpense\u201d. We\u2019ll be using that for the main project, but first lets take a closer look at the new techniques required for this project\u2026","topics":[],"score":248052,"global_rank":65883},{"name":"jardiamj/CSC143_Utility","owner":"jardiamj","html_url":"https://github.com/jardiamj/CSC143_Utility","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Utility tools for CSC143 class - Java II","topics":[],"score":248052,"global_rank":65886}]